{1 = 1-4}
9=1.	@wRN{Iddin-@wDN{Dagan}}, in his majestic location @wDN{An} has decided a great fate for you, 
13=2.	has made the just crown shine for you, 
17=3.	has raised you to shepherdship over the Land, 
21=4.	has placed the foreign lands at your feet. 

{5 = 5-13}
25=5.	@wDN{Enlil} has looked at you truly, @wRN{Iddin-@wDN{Dagan}}, 
29=6.	he has spoken truly to you. 
33=7.	@wDN{Enlil} has commanded you to keep firm the cosmic bond in @wGN{Sumer}, 
37=8.	to keep the people on the track, 
41=9.	to let @wGN{Sumer} and @wGN{Akkad} relax under your broad protection, 
45=10.	to let the people eat noble food and drink fresh water. 
49=11.	@wRN{Iddin-@wDN{Dagan}}, 
53=12.	you are the shepherd in his heart, 
57=13.	the one whom @wDN{Enlil} has spoken to truly. 

{14 = 14-17}
61=14.	@wDN{Enki} has brought to you, @wRN{Iddin-@wDN{Dagan}}, broad understanding, 
65=15.	knowledge of everything, wise command, 
69=16.	a life (?) that comes from the mouth of a lion. 
73=17.	May all the foreign lands praise you. 

{18 = 18-23}
77=18.	Son born to @wDN{Dagan}, elevated lord who increases the people, 
81=19.	@wRN{Iddin-@wDN{Dagan}}, may you look approvingly on your city. Balm of the heart who neglects nothing, 
85=20.	@wDN{Enlil} rejoices in you. 
89=21.	When like @wDN{Utu} you bring forth a just light, 
93=22.	people's eyes are indeed directed towards it. 
97=23.	All the foreign lands stay calm under your broad protection. 

{24 = 24-34}
101=24.	You have put the highways and roads in order, 
105=25.	made the Land content, 
109=26.	placed justice in every mouth, 
113=27.	made propriety resplendent. 
117=28.	You have marked the borders (?) and fixed the boundaries, 
121=29.	made @wGN{Sumer} and @wGN{Akkad} raise their necks. 
125=30.	@wRN{Iddin-@wDN{Dagan}}, 
129=31.	you have restored the purification rituals of the deities which you have organised. 
133=32.	What you order ……. 
137=33.	Your word reaches holy heaven, 
141=34.	your utterances cover the heavens. 

{35 = 35-42}
145=35.	At @wDN{Enlil's} command, 
149=36.	your gaze brings men life, 
153=37.	your conversation brings men health. 
157=38.	@wDN{Enlil} rejoices in your speech. 
161=39.	@wDN{Ninlil} declares @q[Ninlil,Iddin-Dagan]{“so be it”} to your desires. 
165=40.	Shepherd @wDN{Enlil} is your support. 
169=41.	@wRN{Iddin-@wDN{Dagan}}, who is built like you? 
173=42.	People's eyes are directed towards you. 

{43 = 43-46}
177=43.	You are indeed the man for the @wTN{E-kur}. 
181=44.	May your offerings in the house of @wDN{Enlil} never cease. 
185=45.	May the brickwork of the @wTN{E-kur} speak well of you to @wDN{Enlil} and @wDN{Ninlil}. 
189=46.	At the favourable word of @wDN{An} and @wDN{Enlil}, @wRN{Iddin-@wDN{Dagan}}, may princely strength be yours. 

{47 = 47-52}
193=47.	Your magnificent reputation exists throughout the Land -- your name dazzles to the horizon. 
197=48.	Mighty man, 
201=49.	standing in battle and conflict with heroism and strength, 
205=50.	you come to batter rebellious lands. 
209=51.	From the womb @wDN{Dagan} decreed that as your destiny. 
213=52.	He has placed your praise in all mouths. 

{53 = 53-59}
217=53.	Your kingship is good for the people. After your shepherdship had pleased the heart, 
221=54.	the people became numerous under you, the people spread wide under you. 
225=55.	All the foreign lands lie down in pastures thanks to you. 
229=56.	The people spend their days in abundance thanks to you. 
233=57.	The black-headed direct their gaze on you, 
237=58.	@wRN{Iddin-@wDN{Dagan}}, 
241=59.	as on your father. 

{60 = 60-63}
245=60.	@wRN{Iddin-@wDN{Dagan}}, may @wDN{Enlil}, 
249=61.	the lord who determines fate, 
253=62.	make your days long. 
257=63.	May he who knows everything look approvingly on you with approbation. 

{64 = 64-70}
261=64.	May your exceeding wisdom, given by the tablets of @wDN{Nisaba}, never cease on the clay in the tablet house. 
265=65.	In this tablet house, like a shrine fashioning everything, may it never come to an end. 
269=66.	May @wDN{Nisaba}, 
273=67.	the shining …… lady, 
277=68.	give wisdom to the junior scribe who puts his hand to the clay and writes this on it. 
281=69.	May she show generosity. 
285=70.	In the place of writing may she come forth like the sun for him. 

